{"id":"word:hebrew:H8336","type":"word","title":"שֵׁשׁ","subtitle":"H8336 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"bleached stuff, i.e. white linen or (by analogy) marble","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שֵׁשׁ (H8336) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 42 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שֵׁשׁ (shêsh) means bleached stuff, i.e. white linen or (by analogy) marble First listed occurrence: Esth 1 6."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שֵׁשׁ","transliteration":"shêsh","pronunciation":"shaysh","strong":"H8336","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8336","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["וְ/שֵׁ֥שׁ","וְ/שֵׁ֣שׁ","שֵׁ֣שׁ","שֵׁ֔שׁ","שֵׁ֑שׁ"],"morphs":[["HAcfsa",19],["HC/Acfsa",16],["HTd/Ncmsa",3],["HC/Rd/Ncmsa",2],["HRd/Ncmsa",1],["HNcmsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"bleached stuff, i.e. white linen or (by analogy) marble","usage":"× blue, fine (twined) linen, marble, silk.","full":"H8336. shesh II. שֵׁשׁ noun masculine id.; — שׁ ׳עַמּוּדֵי Song 5:15 (in figurative), Est 1:6 a, material of pavement 1:6 b (see בַּ֫הַט ). — I. שֵׁשׁ see שׁדשׁ . III. שֵׁשׁ noun masculine Exod 26:1 byssus (loan-word probably from Egyptian šen-suten Reinischap.DHM VOJ viii (1894), 7 Coptic šens , compare Coptic šent , weave ; see M'Lean Ency.Bib. LINEN ; on spinning, weaving, and wearing of linen in Egypt Erman Aegypten 594 ff.; Eng. Trans. 448 f. ); — always absolute ׳שׁ ( שׁשׁי Ezek 16:13 is error): — byssus , fine Egyptian linen ( בּוּץ , q. v., is later synonym), i.e. the linen thread (spun by women Exod 35:25 ), and the material woven from it: used for garments Gen 41:42 (E), Ezek 16:10 , 13 ( שׁשׁי , read שׁשׁ ), Prov 31:22 ; for sail (in figurative of Tyre as ship) Ezek 27:7 (brought from Egypt); elsewhere P, of priestly vestments Exod 28:5 , 39 (twice in verse); 39:3 , 27 , 28 (twice in verse); also ׳שׁ מָשְׁזָר twisted linen 28:6 , 8 , 15 ; 39:2 , 5 , 8 , 28 , 29 + 39:24 (read ᵐ5 ⅏ מ ׳וְשֵׁשׁ Bae); ׳שׁ of hangings, etc., in tabernacle 25:4 ; 35:6 , 23 , 25 , 35 ; 38:23 , and so ׳שׁ מָשְׁזָר 26:1 , 31 , 36 ; 27:9 , 16 , 18 ; 36:8 , 35 , 37 ; 38:9 , 16 , 18 .","rootNote":"or (for alliteration with 4897 ) שְׁשִׁי ; for 7893 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Esth 1 6","keyReferences":["Esth 1 6","Esth 1 6","Exod 25 4","Exod 26 1","Exod 26 31","Exod 26 36","Exod 27 9","Exod 27 16"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":42,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Esth 1 6","book":"Esth","chapter":1,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֵׁ֑שׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcfsa"},{"reference":"Esth 1 6","book":"Esth","chapter":1,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וָ/שֵׁ֖שׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 25 4","book":"Exod","chapter":25,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֵׁ֥שׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 26 1","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֵׁ֣שׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 26 31","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֵׁ֣שׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 26 36","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":36,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֵׁ֣שׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 27 9","book":"Exod","chapter":27,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֵׁ֣שׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 27 16","book":"Exod","chapter":27,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֵׁ֥שׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 27 18","book":"Exod","chapter":27,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֵׁ֣שׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 28 5","book":"Exod","chapter":28,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שֵּֽׁשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 2